'''NPCs''', or '''Non-Player Characters''', are characters that are found scattered around [[SkyBlock]]. Players can interact with NPCs to perform various actions.

== Interactions ==
'''NPCs''' can be typically be interacted with by {{Yellow|right-clicking}} them. Most of them have dialogue that is triggered, often times multiple lines of dialogue under different conditions. These dialogues may provide information that help players to navigate in the game and interact with different game mechanics.

Some NPCs lead the player to starting or proceeding with a [[Quest]]. 

Some NPCs feature [[Shops]] with various items items. Most of these shops have a daily buy limit of 640 items, which resets at 12:00 AM GMT, or 8:00 PM EST. For NPCs that do sell items, it is possible to profit by buying these items and selling them for higher than their purchase price on the [[Bazaar]]. This technique is known as [[NPC Flipping]].

